<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 12:36:37 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“他们没有灵魂”：Ben &amp;amp; Jerry 的联合创始人如何成为自己公司最大的批评者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/they-aint-got-no-soul-how-ben-jerrys-co-founder-became-his-own-companys-biggest-critic/</link><description>本·科恩正在发起一场针对以他的名字命名的冰淇淋公司的公开运动，指责该公司的所有者破坏了他赖以建立的社会使命。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279247278.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:06:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/they-aint-got-no-soul-how-ben-jerrys-co-founder-became-his-own-companys-biggest-critic/</guid></item><item><title>“变得流氓”：是时候停止像人一样谈论有缺陷的人工智能前沿模型了吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/going-rogue-faulty-ai-frontier-models-openai-anthropic/</link><description>我们应该小心，不要让我们将人类品质赋予非人类的愿望掩盖了眼前的严重问题——当人工智能模型出错时谁来负责？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2261852583-e1786103190854.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:48:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/going-rogue-faulty-ai-frontier-models-openai-anthropic/</guid></item><item><title>您未来的劳动力已经为您工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/your-future-workforce-already-works-for-you-mercer-ravin-jesuthasan/</link><description>很多时候，当我们听到高管谈论开创人工智能工作的新时代时，他们的重点是裁员和招聘新的数字化人才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RJ-Home-Mobile.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/your-future-workforce-already-works-for-you-mercer-ravin-jesuthasan/</guid></item><item><title>据报道，OpenAI 的新设备是一款价值 300 美元的便携式甜甜圈，可以监视你</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/openai-device-300-dollar-donut/</link><description>今天早上到达办公室之前您需要了解的所有信息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1395990185.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 10:27:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/openai-device-300-dollar-donut/</guid></item><item><title>在痴迷人工智能的硅谷，直播商务平台 Whatnot 刚刚完成新一轮融资，估值达 200 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/ai-obsessed-silicon-valley-live-commerce-platform-whatnot-new-funding-round-20-billion/</link><description>5.45 亿美元的 G 轮融资几乎使 Whatnot 的估值翻了一番——在几乎所有风险投资资金都流向人工智能的时刻，这是消费市场罕见的突破。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/55323125671_c3c2d093d5_6k-e1786052270579.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:17:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/ai-obsessed-silicon-valley-live-commerce-platform-whatnot-new-funding-round-20-billion/</guid></item><item><title>由于继任者渠道枯竭，董事会正在招聘退休的首席执行官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/retired-ceos-succession-planning/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1053575434-e1786094920532.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:36:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/retired-ceos-succession-planning/</guid></item><item><title>每 10 个职位就有 2,539 名申请者，一家顶级招聘平台的首席执行官针对求职地狱给出了一个解决方案：“不要申请 OpenAI”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/every-10-jobs-2539-applicants-greenhouse-ceo-daniel-chait-hiring-advice-openai/</link><description>Greenhouse 首席执行官丹尼尔·柴特 (Daniel Chait) 表示，求职地狱是真实存在的——每位招聘人员的申请数量增加了 412%，但其中大多数人都在寻找同样著名的公司&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/greenhouse_CEO_Daniel_Chait-.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/every-10-jobs-2539-applicants-greenhouse-ceo-daniel-chait-hiring-advice-openai/</guid></item><item><title>卡塔尔的 Ooredoo、Nvidia 和诺基亚推出价值数十亿美元的人工智能计算平台——东南亚是他们的目标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/qatar-ooredoo-nvidia-nokia-unveil-multi-billion-dollar-ai-compute-platformand-southeast-asia-is-their-target/</link><description>卡塔尔 Ooredoo 首席执行官在接受《财富》杂志独家采访时透露，为何东南亚是该公司从传统电信公司向领先数字基础设施提供商转型的下一个重要战场&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ooredoo-CEO-e1785966877954.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:00:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/qatar-ooredoo-nvidia-nokia-unveil-multi-billion-dollar-ai-compute-platformand-southeast-asia-is-their-target/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能将会变得更便宜。企业人工智能账单可能不会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/ai-will-get-cheaper-enterprise-ai-bills-probably-wont/</link><description>企业不能再认为购买人工智能就等于控制其成本。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DA20220407_-_CEO_Announcement_-_750x422.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/07/ai-will-get-cheaper-enterprise-ai-bills-probably-wont/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 7 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-07-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-7.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:22:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-07-2026/</guid></item></channel></rss>